摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A loop dock for DeepSeek Harness: one harness, multiple agent loops.","id":"gh:1335746326","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-loop-dock","slug":"euuuuuuzer/dsh-loop-dock","topics":["agent-loop","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","heterogeneous-agents","llm","multi-agent"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A loop dock for DeepSeek Harness: one harness, multiple agent loops."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-loop-dock"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> One harness. Multiple agent loops."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"`dsh-loop-dock` is a community infrastructure plugin for\nDeepSeek Harness (DSH). It\ndoes **not** des"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ign a new agent loop. It provides the dock that lets many loop\nproviders exist in one harness and le"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ts each agent choose which one runs it."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"中文说明"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"1. Install DeepSeek Harness `0.1.0-rc.6` and `pnpm`.\n2. Download `dsh-loop-dock-0.1.0.tgz` from the "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"latest GitHub Release.\n3. Install it into a clean web profile:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"4. Open Settings → General → Default driver and choose `fake-driver`.\n5. Create a new session and se"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"nd any message. The reply is local:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"No API key or network is needed for this first check."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Why dsh-loop-dock?"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"A model's ceiling is not the model alone. The same model can behave very\ndifferently depending on tu"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"rn structure, tool discipline, context management,\nplanning strategy, and execution workflow."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Community plugins have already shown this: small changes around one loop —\na minimal-first preset, a"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" prompt section, a bootstrap hook — can give the same\nmodel meaningfully different behavior."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"DSH already made the Agent Loop a plugin, but the slot is still effectively\nsingle:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"`dsh-loop-dock` opens the next step:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"One harness. Multiple specialized loops."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## What does the dock do?"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The dock is intentionally simple. It does not decide how a loop reasons."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"It provides:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- loop registration\n- loop selection\n- agent-loop binding\n- driver delegation"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The community builds the loops. The dock makes them composable."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Example"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"A future DSH setup could look like:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"`coding-loop`, `research-loop`, and `planning-loop` are community-registered\nloops. Each agent gets:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"instead of forcing every model and task through the same execution pattern."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Try it without a model key"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The bundled patch registers `fake-driver` next to the real `default` driver.\nSwitch the Settings row"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" to `fake-driver`, create a new session, and send any\nmessage. It replies locally:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"No API key and no network are involved. This makes loop and driver routing\nvisible in the first minu"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"API key and no network are involved. This makes loop and driver routing\nvisible in the first minute."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The dock separates two concepts:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"- **Strategy loop** — reuses an existing driver and only installs agent-scoped\nsetup such as prompts"},{"id":"p38s2","text":", presets, hooks, tools, and policies. This is the\ncommon case.\n- **Driver loop** — a complete custo"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"m loop implementation owning\n`createAgent`, `resume`, and turn control flow. This is for fundamental"},{"id":"p38s4","text":"ly\ndifferent execution architectures."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## Current Status"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Pre-alpha, but runnable."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"- ✅ Loop registry\n- ✅ Agent → loop routing\n- ✅ Durable loop + driver binding\n- ✅ Driver selection\n- "},{"id":"p41s2","text":"✅ Strategy loop protocol\n- ✅ Driver loop protocol\n- ✅ Default headless driver\n- ✅ Official `standard"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"` strategy slot\n- ✅ Multi-agent integration tests"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"The dock is working. The ecosystem is the next step."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"See docs/architecture.md for the roadmap."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## FAQ"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"- **preset, loop, and driver** — preset defines tools/prompt sections; driver is the engine; loop is"},{"id":"p45s2","text":" the complete loop an agent runs.\n- **Official `dsh-agent-loop`** — the dock disables the official r"},{"id":"p45s3","text":"ow and owns the single `AgentFactory` slot; a vendored headless derivative is the default driver.\n- "},{"id":"p45s4","text":"**fake-driver** — a local debug driver that never calls a model or the network; it always replies wi"},{"id":"p45s5","text":"th `[FAKE-DRIVER]`.\n- **Do loop authors need a full driver?** — no, strategy loops only implement `s"},{"id":"p45s6","text":"etup(agentCtx)`; a driver loop is only for changing turn control flow itself."},{"id":"p46s1","text":"Full answers: docs/faq.md."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"## Terminology"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"Names follow DeepSeek Harness's own vocabulary (the official package\n`@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-loop` n"},{"id":"p48s2","text":"ever uses \"engine\"; it speaks of the\n\"agent factory and driver service\"):"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"| Our term | What it means | Common / official phrasing |"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"| **driver** | The core agent-loop implementation that owns the `createAgent`/`resume` contract and "},{"id":"p50s2","text":"drives turns (`HeadlessAgentLoop` is the vendored official driver). | Official DSH: *agent loop* / *"},{"id":"p50s3","text":"driver* (\"agent factory and driver service\"). Other harnesses often say *engine* (e.g. Codex engine)"},{"id":"p50s4","text":" — DSH does not use that word. |\n| **loop** | The COMPLETE loop an agent runs, as registered in the "},{"id":"p50s5","text":"`LoopRegistry`: a **strategy loop** (reuses a driver + installs agent-scoped setup) or a **driver lo"},{"id":"p50s6","text":"op** (`kind: 'driver'`, a full custom driver). `loop` is the whole loop; `driver` is only its engine"},{"id":"p50s7","text":" part. | Community: *agent loop* / *loop*. Do not use \"loop\" for the engine layer. |\n| **strategy lo"},{"id":"p50s8","text":"op** | A loop that reuses a driver and only installs per-agent setup (mount a preset, add hooks). Th"},{"id":"p50s9","text":"is is the common case. | Roughly: a preset/profile plus an adapter on top of one engine. |\n| **drive"},{"id":"p50s10","text":"r loop** | A loop that IS a complete driver (`createAgent`/`resume`), for control flow that differs "},{"id":"p50s11","text":"from the default driver. | Roughly: a full engine implementation. |\n| **preset** | DSH's per-session"},{"id":"p50s12","text":" composition (tools + prompt sections), selected via the native picker. | Official DSH: *preset*. No"},{"id":"p50s13","text":"te: in everyday conversation \"preset\" sometimes means the loop — we always mean the tool/prompt comp"},{"id":"p50s14","text":"osition. |\n| **model route** | The provider/model (+ reasoningEffort) a session's requests use. | Co"},{"id":"p50s15","text":"mmunity: model config / model selection. |\n| **AgentFactory** | The `createAgent`/`resume` contract "},{"id":"p50s16","text":"the factory registry delegates to (`ctx.agents.setFactory`). | Official DSH: *AgentFactory*. |\n| **h"},{"id":"p50s17","text":"arness** | The whole agent runtime platform (DSH itself, or Codex, etc.). | Common term across the e"},{"id":"p50s18","text":"cosystem. |\n| **binding** | The durable `{ loop, driver? }` selection the dock records on a session "},{"id":"p50s19","text":"at creation (`agent-preset/selected` `data.agentLoopDock`). | Recorded selection / route binding. |"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
